---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
import { clientLoginHref } from "../lib/links";
---

<BaseLayout title={site.name} description={site.description}>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">The platform behind Webco websites</p>
    <h1>{site.positioning}</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Webco Cloud is for businesses whose websites are built by Webco Media. Hosting, the domain, business email, renewals and support are looked after in one place.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={clientLoginHref()}>Client login</a>
      <a class="button button-quiet" href="/support/">Get support</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
    <h2 id="services-heading">What Webco Cloud looks after</h2>
    <ul class="service-list">
      <li>
        <h3><a href="/hosting/">Hosting</a></h3>
        <p>The website stays online, with SSL, on hosting managed for you.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3><a href="/domains/">Domains</a></h3>
        <p>The domain name is registered, connected and renewed with the website.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3><a href="/email/">Email</a></h3>
        <p>Professional email addresses on your own domain, set up with clear instructions.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3><a href="/support/">Support</a></h3>
        <p>A straightforward place to ask for help with the website, domain and email.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="who-heading">
    <h2 id="who-heading">Who it is for</h2>
    <p>
      The first customers are small and medium UK businesses with a Webco Media website. A particular focus is HGV and transport training providers introduced through LearnHGV.
    </p>
    <p>
      You do not need to manage servers, FTP, databases or DNS. Webco Cloud is the customer-facing home for the website service.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="roles-heading">
    <h2 id="roles-heading">How the names fit together</h2>
    <ol class="role-list">
      <li>
        <p>
          <strong>LearnHGV</strong> introduces relevant website services to HGV and transport training providers. Buying Webco services does not change LearnHGV ranking, verification or directory treatment. Those stay separate.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <strong>Webco Media</strong> designs and builds the website.
          {
            site.webcoMediaUrl && (
              <>
                {" "}
                <a href={site.webcoMediaUrl}>Visit Webco Media</a>.
              </>
            )
          }
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <strong>Webco Cloud</strong> runs hosting, domains, email, billing, renewals and support.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
